Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.80,0:13:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, Lucky, just found another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.74,0:13:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce, the new and\Nimproved, Yani! The anti-smoker cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.20,0:13:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.56,0:13:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cigarettes are evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.34,0:13:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Secondhand smoke is a violation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.52,0:13:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sound like ChatGBT.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.10,0:13:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to need you to start at the\Nbeginning and explain what's happening here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.50,0:13:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.96,0:13:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found this new brainwashing\Napp that just dropped online.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.68,0:13:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Starting today, you are\N100 % allergic to smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.04,0:13:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You find smoking yucky and bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.70,0:13:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even seeing a cigarette\Nwill freak you out. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.32,0:13:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.08,0:14:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I tested it out on Yani, and I'm\Nthinking we have a winner, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.88,0:14:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a walkin' OnlyFans fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.20,0:14:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's with the toothbrushin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.18,0:14:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The app isn't magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.24,0:14:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She still needs something in her mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.86,0:14:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a little scared at how many\Ndifferent ways that could go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.80,0:14:13.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.72,0:14:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.58,0:14:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yaku, what in the world have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.44,0:14:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.35,0:14:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You snuck up on me, Yanni.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.84,0:14:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you scheduled to\Ncome in and work today?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.24,0:14:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's some rigorous teeth brushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.90,0:14:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ew!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.81,0:14:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got some in my freaking mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.34,0:14:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.25,0:14:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fire has been extinguished.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.30,0:14:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a sink fry sheet from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.50,0:14:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's horrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.44,0:15:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My good deed for the day is\Nnow complete. Breaking news.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.58,0:15:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this afternoon just after\Nfour a woman was assaulting
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.74,0:15:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,smokers at the station\Nsmoking area by spitting on
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.26,0:15:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them the prefectural police\Ncontinue their search
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.68,0:15:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for the suspect residents\Nliving in the vicinity
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.74,0:15:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are encouraged to carry\Npertinent information if you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.36,0:15:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see the suspect please\Ntake smoking away from the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.56,0:15:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Girl, she's causing even\Nmore trouble than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.94,0:15:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to eyewitnesses on the scene…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.22,0:15:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, Chainsmoker Cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.92,0:15:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sato! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.46,0:15:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imoko is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.10,0:15:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, beast folk\Nreally know how to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.14,0:15:42.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakku!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.28,0:15:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.46,0:15:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess not all beast folk are athletic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.66,0:16:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.86,0:16:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Top 50 in my class!\NThat's a first! Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.54,0:16:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so bad at math that I just guessed\Nall the answers and I was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.58,0:16:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Imoko, that's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.00,0:16:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're eighth in our grade!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.64,0:16:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're like a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.48,0:16:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or I'm just a really good gasser.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.40,0:16:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the only beast folk who\Nhas zero athletics skill,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.42,0:16:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I don't make up for it with my grades.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.92,0:16:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.83,0:16:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,being in the same class as\NImeko-san just really sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.30,0:16:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.26,0:16:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, there you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.36,0:16:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Imiko-san, um, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.62,0:16:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're up here all by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.46,0:16:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard about your rooftop\Nlunches, and here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.86,0:16:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, uh, yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.38,0:16:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like to read books and stuff, so I\Nprefer places that are quiet, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.42,0:17:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I totally understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.40,0:17:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are definitely times when\NI love having my alone time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.46,0:17:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For me, it's less of a sometimes\Nand more of an every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.20,0:17:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, she's close. Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.22,0:17:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here because I actually\Nwanted to ask you a bit of a favor
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.62,0:17:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a big favor I'm terrible\Nat short essays and I was
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.84,0:17:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hoping you could teach me how\Nto be a better writer But wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.72,0:17:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're asking me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.28,0:17:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sister said you're great She told me\Nyou're in the middle of writing a novel
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.60,0:17:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's a friend of mine, not me Also,\Nyour grades in Japanese are always so good
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.18,0:17:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that impressive I like to\Nread so it makes Japanese class easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.26,0:17:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I think it's so impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.62,0:17:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, um, well then, yeah, if you mean\Nit, of course, I can help you. You will?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.88,0:17:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.50,0:17:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right. I've been\Nmeaning to tell you, Yaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.30,0:18:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd really like it if you\Nstarted calling me Imoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.86,0:18:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, well, I, I can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.38,0:18:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I want you to call me Yomuko.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.12,0:18:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.52,0:18:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will, Yomuko!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.38,0:18:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.86,0:18:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never felt this way before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.54,0:18:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.54,0:18:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to think creators needed\Nloneliness to fuel their creativity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.58,0:18:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I think I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.58,0:18:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One creative person alone creates a spark.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.00,0:18:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when we come together,\Nthat's a bonfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.08,0:18:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I think of it that way, some of the\Nboring stories on here start to make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.22,0:18:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might just be because the\Nwriters didn't have any friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.90,0:18:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.92,0:19:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.68,0:19:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today's a rare treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.14,0:19:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imoko is staying over at her\Nfriend's house, so I'm all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.70,0:19:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for a nice, quiet evening alone.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.45,0:19:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}SHIZUE
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.02,0:19:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darjeeling tea always hits the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.44,0:19:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a delightful aroma.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.48,0:19:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And these cookies I hid from\NImoko are so delicious, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.58,0:19:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But most importantly, tea and sweets are\Nbest enjoyed with a cigarette on the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.16,0:19:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never get tired of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.14,0:19:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I must have fallen asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.24,0:19:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what time it is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.36,0:19:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, the room is filled with smoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.02,0:20:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen this much since\Nmy honeymoon vacation in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.72,0:20:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I got carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.96,0:20:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure all this smoke will\Nbe out of here by tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.00,0:20:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, perfect. It's Imoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.32,0:20:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, Mom. It's me. Yes, honey. I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.48,0:20:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing you're having fun. Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.02,0:20:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming home sooner than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.78,0:20:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.70,0:20:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.61,0:20:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like there was a\Nbreak-in at Hana's house, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.40,0:20:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A break-in means you have to come home?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.50,0:20:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The good news is that there\Nwasn't really any major damage,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.40,0:20:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they called the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.14,0:20:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hana was especially pissed\Nsince they stole her panties.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.86,0:20:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, stolen panties aren't fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.48,0:20:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So anyway, I'll be home\Nin about ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.98,0:20:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and don't stress about dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.40,0:20:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ate already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.31,0:20:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be home soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.30,0:20:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.30,0:20:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have a lot of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.98,0:20:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.60,0:20:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything wrong,\Nso why am I being punished?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.48,0:20:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only there hadn't been that\Nstupid break-in at Hanna's house!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.90,0:20:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does break-in mean come home?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.86,0:21:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm back, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.06,0:21:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, it stinks in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.24,0:21:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're not smoking again, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.34,0:21:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.20,0:21:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.02,0:21:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me get you out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.58,0:21:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.26,0:21:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.90,0:21:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After our phone call, a scary\Nburglar broke into the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.76,0:21:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at what they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.94,0:21:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.30,0:21:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just so grateful they didn't hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.24,0:21:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the man who did this,\Nhe just smoked so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.62,0:21:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He looked like he was some kind of demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.58,0:21:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're really not hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.04,0:21:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.14,0:21:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, my darling, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.14,0:21:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I will never, ever stay\Nover at a prince's house ever again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.58,0:21:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.06,0:22:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, honey, don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.58,0:22:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go as much as you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.20,0:22:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never leave you alone again!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.82,0:22:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}5 DAMAGE DEALT TO SHIZUE'S CONSCIENCE!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.48,0:22:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.96,0:22:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.30,0:23:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do we know how people are here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.74,0:23:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're in trouble,\Nbut they're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.04,0:23:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they're in trouble,\Nbut they're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.14,0:23:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're in trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.50,0:23:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or if they're in trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.50,0:23:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they're in trouble,\Neven if they're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.04,0:23:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll say this is a dream, but I\Ndon't believe that we're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.82,0:23:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.58,0:23:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.58,0:24:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.56,0:25:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.

